  "description": "DICOM for IoTCom.Net as an adapter over fo-dicom (not a rewrite): C-STORE server (receive images from modalities) and client (send to PACS) as IoTCom endpoints with traffic tap and IAsyncEnumerable, a windowed grayscale PNG renderer, and a synthetic CT / MRI / X-ray generator with known findings for testing imaging pipelines. Synthetic images are for software testing only, never for diagnosis. Built by Gravicode Studios, led by Kang Fadhil.",
